      • Persistent LibrarySettings.json + ScriptFlags.json
    
    New features:
      • GlassMorphism theme (translucent, blurred gradient look)
      • Floating restore icon (draggable + customizable)
      • Bottom→top animated notifications
      • CheckBox, UpperTag, MultiTab components
      • Lucide icon support (optional)
      • Custom background image on the window
      • Full theme hot-swap
]]

